<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="What this working copy of the Rotaract Europe site is for."
>
  <main id="content" class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">Terms</p>
      <h1>A working copy, not the live site</h1>
    </header>
    <p>These pages are the IT committee’s draft of the public site. They are here so a change can be reviewed as a diff. They do not replace the terms published at <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/terms-of-use/">rotaracteurope.eu/terms-of-use</a> until the domain is pointed here and the board adopts this text.</p>
    <p>Rotary and Rotaract names and marks stay with Rotary International. Do not treat this repository as a licence to use them outside Rotaract Europe.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
